# MCP Skills (on-demand only)

MCP server skills live in `.cursor/rules/mcp-skills/`. **Do not load any skill content into context unless the user or task clearly needs that MCP.**

- To see the list: reference **@mcp-skills/index** (loads only when you reference it).
- To use a specific MCP: reference **@mcp-skills/<server-name>** (e.g. @mcp-skills/postgres, @mcp-skills/context7) only when the task requires that server.
- Use MCP tools only when a skill is referenced or the task explicitly needs that server; do not preload or assume which MCP to use.
